					"text": "\"Attempt difficult things with easy mind, don't panic, don't go too hard on yourself, take your time and you will succeed. You are not bad, some things require more time, some things are harder for you, some are easier. You can't have it all at the same time. but you can have most of it by the end of your life.\"",
